§ `s 2`

#ASSERT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `an e-scooter` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `an e-bike` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `a kick scooter` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `a motorised toy car` FALSE
#ASSERT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `a nearly built e-scooter` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `an e-scooter kit in a box` FALSE

#ASSERT `the vehicle is a power-assisted bicycle` `an e-bike` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a power-assisted bicycle` `a pedal bicycle` FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a small motorised vehicle` `a pedal bicycle` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the vehicle is a small motorised vehicle` `a delivery trolley with a motor` FALSE
#ASSERT `the vehicle is a small motorised vehicle` `a prescribed electric cargo trike` FALSE

#ASSERT `the vehicle is a personal mobility device` `an e-scooter kit in a box` TRUE

#ASSERT `the vehicle is a power-assisted bicycle` `an e-bike kit in a box` TRUE

